  'customer: ' + customer,
  'error:    ' + String(msg || 'unknown').slice(0, 400),
  'time:     ' + new Date().toISOString(),
  '',
  '\u26A0\uFE0F the autonomous gate check failed — the draft is still in your approval queue with its buttons; handle it normally.',
